    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>action adventure game</strong> (written by S.D. Smith), you play as the young rabbit, Helmer. Determined to reclaim his family farm, Helmer must  <strong>fight</strong> his way out of <strong>the Dragon Tomb</strong>.\u00a0<br><br>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Combat</strong><br>Stay out of sight of patrolling guards or face them head-on. Use your\u00a0<strong>fists to pummel</strong>, your\u00a0<strong>sword to slash</strong>, or the\u00a0<strong>environment to bonk enemies</strong>\u00a0over the noggin'.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Enemies</strong><br>Battle swarms of\u00a0<strong>bats</strong>, fearsome\u00a0<strong>Nightwalkers</strong>, powerful\u00a0<strong>bosses</strong>, and uncover a\u00a0<strong>mysterious force pulling strings behind the scenes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Exploration</strong><br>Navigate a dangerous underground dungeon full of brain-teasing challenges.\u00a0<strong>Move boxes, pull levers, leap across collapsing platforms</strong>, and ride\u00a0<strong>ore buckets</strong>\u00a0through an ancient pulley system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and Secrets</strong><br><strong>Crack open treasure chests</strong>\u00a0hidden deep in the dungeon to find\u00a0<strong>valuable loot</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue and Progression</strong><br><strong>Save prisoners</strong>,\u00a0<strong>evade or defeat enemies</strong>, and\u00a0<strong>respawn at save points</strong>\u00a0when you're overwhelmed. Every scar moves you nearer to legendary status and\u00a0every step brings you closer to the farm you love. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/2009878d73823d3adf7bed31b0af2f2b.avif?t=1754509754\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Level up your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/23b9bc27b25ce9e28a709d23cd01e2b6.avif?t=1754509754\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/3f5ae65b8e9de509550c1bb7e724d72e.avif?t=1754509754\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle bosses!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/dcd684ad31517c45dee1203f888db96a.avif?t=1754509754\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><br>Wishlist this thrilling adventure set deep in the world of the best-selling\u00a0<i>Green Ember</i>\u00a0series!<br><br> Coming this Fall!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>action adventure game</strong> (written by S.D. Smith), you play as the young rabbit, Helmer. Determined to reclaim his family farm, Helmer must  <strong>fight</strong> his way out of <strong>the Dragon Tomb</strong>.\u00a0<br><br>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Combat</strong><br>Stay out of sight of patrolling guards or face them head-on. Use your\u00a0<strong>fists to pummel</strong>, your\u00a0<strong>sword to slash</strong>, or the\u00a0<strong>environment to bonk enemies</strong>\u00a0over the noggin'.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Enemies</strong><br>Battle swarms of\u00a0<strong>bats</strong>, fearsome\u00a0<strong>Nightwalkers</strong>, powerful\u00a0<strong>bosses</strong>, and uncover a\u00a0<strong>mysterious force pulling strings behind the scenes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Exploration</strong><br>Navigate a dangerous underground dungeon full of brain-teasing challenges.\u00a0<strong>Move boxes, pull levers, leap across collapsing platforms</strong>, and ride\u00a0<strong>ore buckets</strong>\u00a0through an ancient pulley system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and Secrets</strong><br><strong>Crack open treasure chests</strong>\u00a0hidden deep in the dungeon to find\u00a0<strong>valuable loot</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue and Progression</strong><br><strong>Save prisoners</strong>,\u00a0<strong>evade or defeat enemies</strong>, and\u00a0<strong>respawn at save points</strong>\u00a0when you're overwhelmed. Every scar moves you nearer to legendary status and\u00a0every step brings you closer to the farm you love. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/2009878d73823d3adf7bed31b0af2f2b.avif?t=1754509754\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Level up your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/23b9bc27b25ce9e28a709d23cd01e2b6.avif?t=1754509754\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/3f5ae65b8e9de509550c1bb7e724d72e.avif?t=1754509754\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle bosses!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/dcd684ad31517c45dee1203f888db96a.avif?t=1754509754\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><br>Wishlist this thrilling adventure set deep in the world of the best-selling\u00a0<i>Green Ember</i>\u00a0series!<br><br> Coming this Fall!</p>",
